[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1026","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0957","title":"pam_mysql 可插拔认证模块SQL注入漏洞","description":"pam_mysql（MySQL 可插拔认证模块）0.4.7 之前版本在构造 SQL 语句时未正确过滤用户输入，存在 SQL 注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用该漏洞，通过向目标系统发送特制的认证请求触发注入，从而获取数据库中的明文密码或密码哈希值。该漏洞影响所有使用 pam_mysql 0.4.7 之前版本的系统，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 0.4.7 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0957"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:51Z","remediation":"升级 pam_mysql 至 0.4.7 或更高版本，该版本修复了用户输入未正确过滤导致的 SQL 注入问题。如无法立即升级，可在 PAM 配置中暂时禁用 pam_mysql 模块，改用其他认证方式（如 pam_unix）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0374.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5447","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0957","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/debb5b9043b725433d6b6e41048f63a9bcce2f7e/2000/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c45038e15e6e81771cce5512f28070ebf02ca969/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0957.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0957.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0957.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1025","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0950","title":"TIS Firewall Toolkit 格式化字符串代码执行漏洞","description":"TIS Firewall Toolkit (FWTK) 中的 x-gw 组件存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 display name 参数提交特制的格式化字符串触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0950"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:50Z","remediation":"建议立即应用 TIS Firewall Toolkit (FWTK) 官方补丁（参见 Bugtraq 2000 年 10 月公告）。由于 FWTK 已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至现代防火墙方案（如 Linux iptables/nftables 或 BSD pf）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对 x-gw 二进制文件的执行权限，移除其 setuid/setgid 位，并严格限制可登录系统的用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0376.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5420","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0950.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0950.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0950","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0950.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0950.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0950.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f050e8fca5626f412366605b1f58958789b2919/2000/CVE-2000-0950.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ca31171c444e5a175f3ac1833b0261c6587a34e9/2000/0xxx/CVE-2