traq/2000-10/0430.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5444","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0939","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2000/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0939.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0939.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0939.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1020","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0938","title":"Samba Samba Web Administration Tool 用户枚举信息泄露漏洞","description":"Samba 2.0.7 中的 Web 管理工具 SWAT（Samba Web Administration Tool）存在用户名枚举漏洞。当远程攻击者尝试登录时，SWAT 对有效用户名和无效用户名返回不同的错误提示信息，攻击者无需认证即可通过对比响应差异逐个枚举服务器上的有效系统用户。该漏洞可被用于信息收集阶段，为后续针对性攻击（如密码爆破）提供目标用户列表，危害等级中等。官方建议升级至 Samba 2.0.8 或更高版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0938"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:48Z","remediation":"升级 Samba 至 2.0.8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SWAT 返回不同错误信息导致用户名枚举的问题。如无法升级，可禁用 SWAT 服务（删除或重命名 /etc/swat 配置文件，或注释 inetd.conf 中 swat 行后重启 inetd/xinetd），并在防火墙限制对 SWAT 端口（901/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0430.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5442","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0938","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b5100979f8c44200a9b65976c3ddceb21c01ae6d/2000/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0938.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0938.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0938.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1020.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1020.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1019","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1019.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0933","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 简体中文版输入法编辑器权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 简体中文版输入法编辑器（IME）存在权限提升漏洞。由于 IME 未正确限制对系统特权功能的访问，本地用户可通过输入法界面调用本应受限的高权限操作，从而获取额外系统权限。攻击者需拥有本地登录权限，无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞实现权限提升，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 简体中文版系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0933"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-069 提供的补丁，下载地址：https://www.microsoft.com/download/details.aspx?FamilyId=6CD4A747-9DE4-4F2F-817F-92BB597B8F5B。该补丁已包含在 Windows 2000 Service Pack 2 中，建议升级至 SP2 或更高版本。如无法安装补丁，可在登录屏幕中禁用简体中文输入法编辑器（IME），或限制物理键盘和终端服务器会话的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1729","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-069","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5301","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0933","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2000/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0933.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0933.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0933.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1019.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1019.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1019.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1018","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1018.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0932","title":"ClearSwift MAILsweeper for SMTP 3.x ZIP Archive 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ClearSwift MAILsweeper for SMTP 3.x 在处理 ZIP 压缩包中的损坏 CDA 文档时存在处理逻辑缺陷，导致程序挂起无响应。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标邮件服务器发送特制的包含损坏 CDA 文件的 ZIP 附件触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ClearSwift MAILsweeper for SMTP 3.x 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0932"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"升级到 ClearSWIFT MAILsweeper for SMTP 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ZIP 中损坏 CDA 文档导致的挂起问题。如无法升级，在邮件网关配置中启用深度内容检测，阻止 ZIP 压缩包内的 CDA 文件通过，或直接在 SMTP 代理层过滤 application/x-cda 类型的附件作为临时缓解措施。该产品已停止支持，建议迁移至 ClearSWIFT Secure Email Gateway 等现代邮件安全网关。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0181.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5641","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0932","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c6500283f68defe11c86dcd41d1529288a6fc9b1/2000/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0932.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0932.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0932.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1018.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1017","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0931","title":"Pegasus Mail 3.11 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pegasus Mail 3.11 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过发送包含二进制数据的超长电子邮件触发该漏洞，导致远程拒绝服务攻击，甚至可能实现任意代码执行。该漏洞属于经典的栈缓冲区溢出类型，由于程序未对邮件内容长度进行有效边界检查，当处理过长的二进制数据时发生内存越界写入，破坏程序控制流。攻击条件为远程未经身份认证即可利用（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N），只需向目标发送精心构造的恶意邮件即可触发。影响范围限于 Pegasus Mail 3.11 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。厂商已停止维护该版本，建议升级至最新版本或迁移至其他邮件客户端。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0931"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Pegasus Mail 3.11 版本，升级至厂商发布的最新稳定版本。由于该版本过于陈旧且缺乏安全维护，若无法升级，建议更换为现代的安全邮件客户端，或在网络防火墙层面拦截异常长度的二进制邮件载荷以减轻风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/137518","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1750","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0931","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c6500283f68defe11c86dcd41d1529288a6fc9b1/2000/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0931.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0931.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0931.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1016","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0928","title":"WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 目录文件信息泄露漏洞","description":"WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 4.1 存在目录遍历信息泄露漏洞。本地用户可通过在目标共享上运行报告功能，列出服务器上的目录和文件列表，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者需具有本地访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞获取系统文件结构信息，为后续攻击提供情报支持。该漏洞影响 WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 4.1 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0928"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"由于 WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 4.1 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即卸载该软件并迁移至其他受支持的磁盘配额管理工具（如 Microsoft 文件服务器资源管理器 FSRM）。如无法卸载，应严格限制软件安装目录（默认 Program Files\\WQuinn\\）的 NTFS 权限，仅允许管理员组读取和执行；同时通过组策略或注册表禁用非管理员用户运行报告功能的权限，并在共享文件夹上设置最小必要权限（去除 Everyone 组的读取权限）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0091.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1765","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5327","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0928","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb4fa88be1e2cec066471c94ef8377b081c79cb6/2000/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0928.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0928.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0928.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1015","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0927","title":"WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 安全绕过漏洞","description":"WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 4.1 在处理存储在备用数据流（ADS）中的文件时，未能正确记录文件实际大小，导致本地用户可通过将文件写入 NTFS 备用数据流来绕过磁盘配额限制。攻击者只需拥有本地系统访问权限即可利用此漏洞，无需特殊权限，影响运行 WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 4.1 的 Windows 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0927"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:47Z","remediation":"升级 WQuinn QuotaAdvisor 至 4.1 以上已修复此漏洞的版本；如厂商已停止维护，建议改用 Windows 内置磁盘配额管理（NTFS 配额），在卷属性中启用配额限制并勾选\"拒绝将磁盘空间给超过配额限制的用户\"。同时启用文件系统审计策略，监控 NTFS 备用数据流（ADS）的创建行为，通过 PowerShell 定期扫描可疑 ADS 文件。作为临时缓解措施，限制用户对卷的写入权限以减少 ADS 滥用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09//0331.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0173.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1724","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5302","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0927","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/124ab3e5e42be0a51c386ce59b3e73127df55887/2000/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0927.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0927.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0927.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1014","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0923","title":"Aplio PRO authenticate.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Aplio PRO 设备的 authenticate.cgi CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 password 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Aplio PRO 系列电话设备，攻击者只需能够访问目标设备的 Web 管理界面即可利用，可导致设备完全受控、敏感信息泄露或作为跳板攻击内网其他系统。由于该 CGI 程序未对用户输入进行有效过滤，攻击难度较低，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0923"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:46Z","remediation":"Aplio PRO 产品已停止维护，厂商不再提供安全更新。建议立即将受影响设备从公网断开或下线；如业务必须保留使用，应在网络边界防火墙设置白名单策略，仅允许可信 IP 访问该设备，并在反向代理层对 authenticate.cgi 的 password 参数进行特殊字符过滤（如禁止 |;&`$(){}[]<> 等 shell 元字符），同时启用 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截命令注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0107.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1784","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5333","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0923","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5d2b90135469e518b8bd9c7142a1d639da966b67/2000/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0923.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0923.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0923.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1014.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1014.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1013","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0918","title":"KDE kvt 格式化字符串本地代码执行漏洞","description":"KDE 1.1.2 中的终端模拟器 kvt 存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 DISPLAY 环境变量中注入特制的格式化字符（如 %n），触发格式化字符串漏洞，从而以 kvt 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.1.2 及可能更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0918"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45Z","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 2.0 及以上版本（kvt 在 KDE 2.0 中已修复此格式字符串漏洞），或直接替换终端模拟器为 Konsole（KDE 2.0 起默认终端）。如无法升级 KDE，可移除 kvt 的 setuid 权限（`chmod -s /opt/kde/bin/kvt`）并限制本地用户设置 DISPLAY 环境变量中的格式化字符，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/83914","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1700","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b37ddadc32d456372cb07846a95b411ce7a32d9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37be0559d0574b93d433d6c01d9f77ea4c420519/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0918","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-09xx/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7597ddfeff03aa9cd00b0ce83a368fad007497d9/2000/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0918.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0918.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0918.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1012","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0915","title":"FreeBSD fingerd 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 4.1.1 系统中的 fingerd 服务存在任意文件读取漏洞。由于 fingerd 未对用户输入进行充分过滤，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过指定目标文件名替代常规用户名的方式，向 fingerd 服务发送特制请求，从而读取系统上的任意文件内容。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前暂无官方补丁信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0915"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-12-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:45Z","remediation":"升级 FreeBSD 至 4.1.1-STABLE（2000-10-05 之后版本），或应用官方补丁修改 finger.c 源码：在参数遍历循环中增加对以 '/' 开头的参数的校验拦截，重新编译 finger 和 fingerd 二进制。临时缓解措施：在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释掉 finger 服务行（finger stream tcp nowait/3/10 nobody /usr/libexec/fingerd fingerd -s），重启 inetd 或发送 SIGHUP 使其生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-10/0017.html","http://www.osvdb.org/433","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1803","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5385","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0915.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0915.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0915","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0915.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0915.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2